psi=sqrt(pi) has norm1 and its Rayleigh quotient for T_pi equals<pi,Ppi>>=1 by PSD Walsh coefficients and Epi=1. Thus lambda1>=1. Gram-spectrum equality with QM_piQ and endpoint Holder give lambda1<=B. Strict positivity gives a unique positive unit Perron vector w and D=lambda1-lambda2>0; PSD gives lambda2>=0 and D<=B.
